{
  "lecture_id": "lecture-03",
  "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "逼近问模型族中是否存在拟合函数，优化问能否找到它，泛化问未见数据上是否有效；本讲集中于逼近。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "函数输出变化的绝对值不超过输入变化的 L 倍；多维输入使用 RMS 范数。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 8
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "RMS 范数等于各坐标平方平均的平方根，表示向量坐标的平均尺度。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "单位 d 维超立方体上的任意 L-Lipschitz 函数，对任意 ε>0，存在规模为 4d(L/ε)^d 的三层 ReLU 网络，使积分 L1 误差小于 2ε。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 10
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "N 条等宽区间中，每条的最大偏差形成底 1/N、高 L/N 的三角形；总面积不超过 L/(2N)，故 N=L/(2ε) 足以达到 ε。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 12
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "N 个超矩形边长 N^{-1/d}，误差帽高度 L/N^{1/d}，合计误差不超过 L/N^{1/d}；达到 ε 需 N=(L/ε)^d。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "四个带平移的 ReLU 按 +1,-1,-1,+1 线性组合，在 c→∞ 时逼近 [0,1] 的矩形指示；权重和偏置可平移矩形。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "各坐标的一维矩形全部开启时，和才超过 d−1；在该阈值施加 ReLU 得到超矩形，再用带位置参数的超矩形线性组合逼近曲面。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 16
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "构造需要对维数指数增长的神经元；矩形表示若只落在训练点上并被权重衰减抑制其他部分，可能不泛化。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 18
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 19
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fourier 级数、多项式和 Python 程序空间也具有广泛表达能力，但这不意味着通常用它们完成机器学习；普适逼近不足以保证学习成功。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 21
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ReLU 本身分段线性，分段线性函数对和、复合、标量乘法封闭，因此 ReLU 网络可用梯度改变处 kink 的数量分析。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 27
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "宽度 n 的线性组合至多累加 kinks，ReLU 至多将线性片段一分为二，所以 KINKS_l≤2n KINKS_{l−1}，从 KINKS_0=1 得 KINKS_L≤(2n)^L。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 28
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 29
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 30
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 31
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "宽度 2 的三角形 ReLU 函数每次与自身复合使线性区域数翻倍。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 32
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "g 自复合 500 次有 2^500−1 个 kinks，以 1000 层、宽度 2 表示；若换成三层网络，匹配该 kink 数需约 7×10^49 宽度。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 33
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "深度分离不意味着深网络容易训练或泛化良好；寻找实际最优宽深比还会受学习率等训练管线混杂因素影响。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 34
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 37
        },
        {
